    "type": "\u2200 {k n L : \u2115} (cuts : RiffleUpperV2.Cuts k n (L + 1)) (D : \u2115) (g \u03be : \u211d) (p : Fin k)\n  (d : RiffleUpperV2.Exploration.Direction) (i : \u2115),\n  \u2191n ^ \u03be \u2264 \u2191(RiffleUpperV2.Exploration.pileSize cuts p) \u2192\n    \u2200 (\u03c9 : RiffleUpperV2.Sample cuts \u00d7 RiffleUpperV2.Sample cuts),\n      (RiffleUpperV2.conditionalExpect (RiffleUpperV2.independentPairLaw cuts)\n          (fun (v : RiffleUpperV2.Sample cuts \u00d7 RiffleUpperV2.Sample cuts) =>\n            \u2191(RiffleUpperV2.Exploration.remainingDirectionalCount cuts D g \u03be p d i v.1 v.2))\n          fun (v : RiffleUpperV2.Sample cuts \u00d7 RiffleUpperV2.Sample cuts) =>\n          RiffleUpperV2.Exploration.pairHistory cuts p d i v = RiffleUpperV2.Exploration.pairHistory cuts p d i \u03c9) \u2264\n        (RiffleUpperV2.Conditional.historySelfIntersection cuts D g p d i \u03c9.1 +\n            RiffleUpperV2.Conditional.historySelfIntersection cuts D g p d i \u03c9.2) /\n          2"
